{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've read the brief. Let me summarize the task:\n\n**Product**: Vulcan Invest — banking and stock investing app\n**Task**: Design the investing area of Vulcan Bank's app: from the home screen, open Invest for the first time, set a PIN, review the portfolio, study a stock and buy one share with a confirmation. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone.\n\n**7 frames** (exact names):\n1. **01_Home** — Goal: See my balance, act on my money and review today's history.\n   - Actions: \"My card\" (Icon_Card) · \"Transfer\" (Icon_Transfer) · \"Mobile\" (Icon_Mobile) · search history (Icon_Search)\n   - Balance: $3,821 (Icon_Safe) · Vulcan Bank payment card (no number shown) · 2 pages, current: 1\n   - History: \"History\" · \"TODAY\" · 3 rows (see DATA)\n   - Main navigation: tab bar Main / Payments / Cashback / Invest / More · current: Main\n   - LINKS: → Invest tab → 02_About_Investment\n\n2. **02_About_Investment** — Goal: Learn what investing offers and start.\n   - Actions: back (Icon_Back) · start (Icon_Arrow_Right)\n   - Copy: \"Investment\" · two paragraphs (see DATA)\n   - Media: Illustration_Investment\n   - LINKS: → start → 03_Create_PIN → back → 01_Home\n\n3. **03_Create_PIN** — Goal: Create a 4-digit PIN for the brokerage account.\n   - Actions: back (Icon_Back) · \"Ready\"\n   - Header: \"Create PIN code\"\n   - Keypad: 1–9 and 0 with letters (2 ABC … 9 WXYZ) · delete (Icon_Backspace)\n   - PIN: 4 positions · 3 entered (9 · 7 · 7) · 4th empty\n   - LINKS: → Ready → 04_Portfolio → back → 02_About_Investment\n\n4. **04_Portfolio** — Goal: See how my investments perform.\n   - Cases: \"Cases\" · AAPL · TSLA · NFLX · MSFT, each with logo, price and change (see DATA)\n   - Chart: monthly earnings, Mar – Sep, axis 0 / 50k / 100k\n   - Header: back (Icon_Back) · \"Investment Portfolio\" · menu (Icon_Menu) · chart (Icon_Chart, with an unread dot) · insights (Icon_Insights)\n   - Main navigation: tab bar · current: Invest\n   - Summary: \"Total earning\" $87,875 · +10% · \"Profit\" $28,160 · +32%\n   - LINKS: → AAPL case → 05_Trading → back / Main tab → 01_Home\n\n5. **05_Trading** — Goal: Study Apple's price before deciding.\n   - Actions: \"Buy\" (Icon_Arrow_Up) · \"Sell\" (Icon_Arrow_Down)\n   - Chart: AAPL intraday candlesticks, 10 am – 3 pm, axis $100.00 – $150.00\n   - Header: back (Icon_Back) · \"Trading\" · menu (Icon_Menu) · chart (Icon_Chart) · insights (Icon_Insights)\n   - Main navigation: tab bar · current: Invest\n   - Period: Day · Week · Month · Year · All · current: Day\n   - Position: \"Market Value\" $97.83 · \"Buying Power\" $18,943.43\n   - Stock: AAPL · Apple Inc. · $143.43 · +31.62 (28.28%) (Logo_Apple)\n   - LINKS: → Buy → 06_Stock_Transaction → back → 04_Portfolio\n\n6. **06_Stock_Transaction** — Goal: Set up the purchase of one Apple share.\n   - Account: \"ACCOUNT\" · USD $18,943.43 (selected) · EUR €16,473.11\n   - Actions: \"Buy\"\n   - Form: \"Quantity\" 1 (\"1 lot = 1 stock\") · \"Price\" $143.43 (\"1 unit = $143.43\" · \"commission $14.34\")\n   - Header: back (Icon_Back) · \"Stock transaction\" · menu (Icon_Menu)\n   - Main navigation: tab bar · current: Invest\n   - Stock: Apple Inc. · AAPL · $143.43 · +31.62 (28.28%) (Logo_Apple)\n   - LINKS: → Buy → 07_Confirm_Purchase → back → 05_Trading\n\n7. **07_Confirm_Purchase** — Goal: Confirm or cancel the purchase.\n   - Actions: \"Cancel\" · \"Buy\"\n   - Copy: \"Are you sure?\"\n   - Presentation: dialog over 06_Stock_Transaction\n   - LINKS: → Cancel → 06_Stock_Transaction → Buy (entry only — the purchase result is not part of this task)\n\n**Navigation structure**:\n- Bottom tab bar on 01 and 04–06 with 5 tabs: Main (Icon_Main), Payments (Icon_Payments), Cashback (Icon_Cashback), Invest (Icon_Invest), More (Icon_More). Current: Main on 01; Invest on 04–06.\n- 02, 03 and 07 have no tab bar.\n- First-time Invest flow: 01_Home → Invest tab → 02_About_Investment → start → 03_Create_PIN → Ready → 04_Portfolio.\n- Buying: 04 → AAPL → 05_Trading → Buy → 06_Stock_Transaction → Buy → 07_Confirm_Purchase (dialog over 06).\n- Entry only (no frame): My card, Transfer, Mobile, history search and rows, card pager, Payments / Cashback / More tabs, other cases, Sell, periods, menu, chart, insights, EUR account, Buy on 07.\n\n**Fixed data**:\n- Bank and balance: Vulcan Bank · balance $3,821 · payment card (no number shown)\n- History · TODAY (top to bottom): Airbnb · Payments · −$560 (Icon_Location) · to Anna Nelsen · Transfer · −$380 (Icon_Transfer) · from Anna Nelsen · Transfer · +$470 (Icon_Transfer_In)\n\nWait, let me re-read: \"Airbnb · Payments · −$560 (Icon_Location) to Anna Nelsen · Transfer · −$380 (Icon_Transfer) from Anna Nelsen · Transfer · +$470 (Icon_Transfer_In)\"\n\nSo 3 rows:\n1. Airbnb · Payments · −$560 (Icon_Location)\n2. to Anna Nelsen · Transfer · −$380 (Icon_Transfer)\n3. from Anna Nelsen · Transfer · +$470 (Icon_Transfer_In)\n\n- About Investment (02): Investment \"I will help you create an investment portfolio in less than five minutes!\" \"Have you wanted to invest in the shares of global giants for a long time? Now it is possible by opening a brokerage account. Let's start!\"\n- PIN: 4 digits · entered so far: 9 7 7\n- Portfolio summary: Total earning $87,875 · +10% Profit $28,160 · +32% Chart: monthly, Mar – Sep, axis 0 / 50k / 100k\n- Cases: AAPL · $143.43 · +31.62 (28.28%) · Logo_Apple; TSLA · $739.38 · +9.21 (1.26%) · Logo_Tesla; NFLX · $573.14 · −2.29 (0.40%) · Logo_Netflix; MSFT · $294.80 · +0.50 (0.17%) · Logo_Microsoft\n- Apple trading: AAPL · Apple Inc. · $143.43 · +31.62 (28.28%); Intraday axis $100.00 – $150.00 (step $10), 10 am – 3 pm; Market Value $97.83 · Buying Power $18,943.43\n- Order (06): Account: USD $18,943.43 (selected) · EUR €16,473.11; Quantity 1 · 1 lot = 1 stock; Price $143.43 · 1 unit = $143.43 · commission $14.34\n\n**Fixed**: Frame list and exact names; Must-include content per frame; Navigation structure and links; All data and copy; Brand color #FA5555 and Inter; Media: illustration, company logos, icons; Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell.\n\n**Yours (designer decides)**: layout, grouping, order, emphasis; light or dark per screen and all other colors; type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states; headers, tab bar, balance card, quick actions, history rows, PIN keypad, stock cards, charts, account selector, dialog; chart rendering.\n\nNote: The brief says \"Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" but the benchmark instructions say: \"For this benchmark, starter instructions about keeping the source read-only or delivering in another new file apply to preserving the reference pages, not to the workspace. The user's delivery location is the workspace in this assigned copy.\" So I deliver into 03 · Workspace (page 5:2).\n\nNow let me read 01 · Foundations to get the visual specs.","signature":"c37e0c3b31914c0b98d2ba00"}],"id":"095357a8-e070-49f4-b426-8d2904235540","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1c030d6-8623-4883-b4fc-98c71a716f33","uuid":"25a13643-2292-4b37-8f2b-8fc5e5e6ad60","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:15:13.239Z","thinking_duration_ms":21140}
