\"462\" y=\"0\" width=\"414\" height=\"34\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1c030d6-8623-4883-b4fc-98c71a716f33","uuid":"8217687b-85cf-4607-9ffd-19b8ecae8f4c","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:15:26.709Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"1:3\" name=\"02 · Components 组件库\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"1:19\" name=\"Components\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"611\">\n    <text id=\"1:20\" name=\"Components · Vulcan Invest (default states only)\" x=\"56\" y=\"48\" width=\"764\" height=\"39\" />\n    <text id=\"1:21\" name=\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, error, disabled, current tab, current period, selected account…), the headers, the tab bar, the PIN keypad, the dialog and every business component (balance card, quick actions, history rows, stock cards, charts, account selector…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\" x=\"56\" y=\"107\" width=\"1288\" height=\"57\" />\n    <text id=\"1:22\" name=\"Button · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"184\" width=\"134\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:23\" name=\"Button\" x=\"56\" y=\"226\" width=\"374\" height=\"56\" />\n    <text id=\"1:25\" name=\"Text Field · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"302\" width=\"160\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:26\" name=\"Text Field\" x=\"56\" y=\"344\" width=\"374\" height=\"77\" />\n    <text id=\"1:30\" name=\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\" x=\"56\" y=\"441\" width=\"358\" height=\"22\" />\n    <text id=\"1:31\" name=\"iOS status bar (with notch) and home indicator, 414 wide, trans