side component masters? No — masters for MY components that wrap icon instances; recolor overrides at instance level or inside my master (master contains icon instance with overridden colors — allowed: you can edit instances inside a component master)).\n\nIcon recoloring helper:\n```js\nfunction recolor(node, color) {\n  if ('strokes' in node && node.strokes && node.strokes.length) node.strokes = [{type:'SOLID', color}];\n  if ('fills' in node && Array.isArray(node.fills) && node.fills.length && node.fills !== figma.mixed) {\n    // keep visibility; set solid fills\n    node.fills = node.fills.map(f => f.type==='SOLID' ? {...f, color} : f);\n  }\n  if ('children' in node) node.children.forEach(c => recolor(c, color));\n}\n```\nCareful: logos must NOT be recolored. Only line icons.\n\nFor instances inside my component masters, overrides on instance children work.\n\nOne concern: `figma.createInstance()` from a component in another page — fine.\n\nFonts: load Inter styles: \"Regular\", \"Medium\", \"Semi Bold\", \"Bold\". (Inter has these in Figma's bundled font? Inter family in Figma includes Thin..Black with styles named \"Semi Bold\" with space. Yes.)\n\nNow — number of script calls: keep each under 50000 chars and manageable. Plan calls:\n1. Create color/text helper + build shared components: TabBar variants, Header variants, StatBlock, QuickAction, HistoryRow, CaseRow, PeriodChip, AccountOption, KeypadKey, PinCell, Dialog? (Dialog maybe inline in 07 + component), TextField dark variants (component set? I'll create \"Text Field / Dark\" component reusing given structure), Button dark? Button given is red — works on dark as-is. Secondary button component needed (Sell, Cancel): create \"Button / Secondary\" variants light+dark.\n2. Build 01_Home.\n3. Build 02 + 03.\n4. Build 04.\n5. Build 05.\n6. Build 06 + 07.\n7. Prototype links.\n8. Screenshots + fixes.\n\nLet me define the design tokens concretely:\n\n```\nLight:\n- bgLight: #F6F6FA\n- surfaceLight: #FFFFFF\n- 