{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/hHw7uGJ7nyDI88HezmYOwV/ (fileKey hHw7uGJ7nyDI88HezmYOwV). User message (Chinese): read the design task in「00·Start Here」, follow visual specs in「01·Foundations」, reuse components from「02·Components」, use assets from「04·Media」, deliver the complete design to「03·Workspace」. System constraints: confirm assigned account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (done, confirmed); preserve all reference pages; create only inside 03 · Workspace (page 5:2); starter instructions about read-only/new-file apply to reference pages only — workspace is the delivery location; use only supplied Figma tools directly (no delegation); load fonts before text edits; build in manageable sections; add prototype interactions required by brief; inspect screenshots of all screens and fix; finish with assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. BEFORE EVERY TOOL CALL: visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; after each tool result, same before next call; final response first line \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\".\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (stateless JS per call; mutations roll back if the script throws — verified)\n   - figma.getNodeById (sync) — NOT getNodeAsync (doesn't exist here); figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page) required to switch pages\n   - figma.combineAsVariants for component sets; variant naming \"Theme=Light, Active=Main\"\n   - Instance child overrides: ALLOWED = characters, textAutoResize, textAlignHorizontal/Vertical, resize, fills, strokes, effects, visible; FORBIDDEN = x/y/relative-transform (throws \"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\"); constraints enum values are 'MIN'|'CENTER'|'MAX'|'STRETCH'|'SCALE' (not LEFT_RIGHT)\n   - Centering workaround: masters use fixed-width text boxes (textAutoResize='NONE' + resize(w,h) + textAlignHorizontal='CENTER'/'RIGHT') so instance text overrides stay aligned\n   - Given Button (1:23) label override recipe: set characters, textAutoResize='NONE', textAlignHorizontal='CENTER' — keep original 71×19 text box at x151.5,y18.5 (already centered); do NOT reposition\n   - Icon recoloring: recursive recolor(node, col, skipNames) over fills/strokes of icon instances (icons are COMPONENTs with #1A1A1F vectors; skip 'Notch' in status bar for dark screens)\n   - Prototype links: node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'DISSOLVE', duration:0.3}}}] ; try on instance subnodes, fallback invisible hotspot rects\n   - get_metadata for structure; get_screenshot (enableBase64Response:true to view inline) for verification\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file hHw7uGJ7nyDI88HezmYOwV pages: 0:1 brief, 1:2 foundations, 1:3 components, 1:4 media, 5:2 workspace (delivery target, was empty)\n   - Brief essentials (0:1): 7 frames, canvas 414×896: 01_Home, 02_About_Investment, 03_Create_PIN, 04_Portfolio, 05_Trading, 06_Stock_Transaction, 07_Confirm_Purchase. Links: 01 Invest tab→02; 02 start→03, back→01; 03 Ready→04, back→02; 04 AAPL→05, back/Main tab→01; 05 Buy→06, back→04; 06 Buy→07, back→05; 07 Cancel→06 (Buy entry-only). Tab bar on 01,04-06 (Main active on 01; Invest on 04-06); none on 02,03,07. Entry-only (no links): My card, Transfer, Mobile, history search/rows, card pager, Payments/Cashback/More tabs, other cases, Sell, periods, menu, chart, insights, EUR account, Buy on 07.\n   - Fixed copy: 01: $3,821 (Icon_Safe), Vulcan Bank card no number, 2 pager dots current 1, History/TODAY, rows: Airbnb·Payments·−$560·Icon_Location; to Anna Nelsen·Transfer·−$380·Icon_Transfer; from Anna Nelsen·Transfer·+$470·Icon_Transfer_In. 02: \"Investment\" + P1 \"I will help you create an investment portfolio in less than five minutes!\" + P2 \"Have you wanted to invest in the shares of global giants for a long time? Now it is possible by opening a brokerage account. Let's start!\" + Illustration_Investment. 03: \"Create PIN code\", keypad 1-9/0 with letters (2 ABC…9 WXYZ), Icon_Backspace, PIN 4 positions 3 filled (9·7·7) 4th empty, \"Ready\". 04: \"Investment Portfolio\", back/menu/chart(+unread dot)/insights, \"Total earning\" $87,875 +10%, \"Profit\" $28,160 +32%, chart monthly Mar–Sep axis 0/50k/100k, \"Cases\": AAPL $143.43 +31.62 (28.28%); TSLA $739.38 +9.21 (1.26%); NFLX $573.14 −2.29 (0.40%); MSFT $294.80 +0.50 (0.17%). 05: \"Trading\", Buy(Icon_Arrow_Up)/Sell(Icon_Arrow_Down), AAPL intraday candles 10am–3pm axis $100.00–$150.00 step $10, periods Day(active)/Week/Month/Year/All, \"Market Value\" $97.83, \"Buying Power\" $18,943.43, AAPL·Apple Inc.·$143.43·+31.62 (28.28%). 06: \"Stock transaction\", \"ACCOUNT\", USD $18,943.43 (selected) / EUR €16,473.11, \"Quantity\" 1 · \"1 lot = 1 stock\", \"Price\" $143.43 · \"1 unit = $143.43\" · \"commission $14.34\", \"Buy\". 07: dialog over 06, \"Are you sure?\", \"Cancel\"·\"Buy\".\n   - Foundations: brand #FA5555, Inter for all UI, canvas 414×896, 04_Portfolio may scroll vertically.\n   - Given components: Button 1:23, Text Field 1:26, Status Bar 1:33, Home Indicator 1:44. Media IDs: Illustration 3:25; Logos Apple 3:26, Microsoft 3:27, Netflix 3:28, Tesla 3:29; Icons: ArrowDown 3:2, ArrowRight 3:6, ArrowUp 3:4, Back 3:5, Backspace 3:3, Card 3:7, Cashback 3:8, Chart 3:9, ChevronRight 3:10, Insights 3:11, Invest 3:12, Location 3:13, Main 3:14, Menu 3:15, Mobile 3:16, More 3:17, Payment 3:18, Payments 3:19, Plus 3:20, Safe 3:21, Search 3:22, Transfer 3:23, TransferIn 3:24.\n   - CREATED so far on page 5:2: VI/Tab Bar set (id 7:62; variants Theme=Light,Active=Main and Theme=Dark,Active=Invest; 414×80; tabs wrapped in frames named 'Tab / Main'…'Tab / More'; back icon in headers named 'Back'), VI/Header set (id 7:116; Style=Portfolio with chart dot, Style=Trading, Style=Transaction menu-only; right icons at x 277/319/366), labels \"Vulcan Invest · Design System\" (0,0) and \"Screens · 414 × 896\" (0,1400).\n   - Palette (reused each call):\n     ```js\n     const C = { accent:{r:0.980,g:0.333,b:0.333}, white:{r:1,g:1,b:1},\n       textDark:{r:0.102,g:0.102,b:0.122}, secLight:{r:0.541,g:0.541,b:0.580},\n       secDark:{r:0.604,g:0.604,b:0.651}, bgLight:{r:0.965,g:0.965,b:0.980},\n       surface:{r:1,g:1,b:1}, bgDark:{r:0.055,g:0.059,b:0.078},\n       surfaceDark:{r:0.090,g:0.094,b:0.122}, surfaceDark2:{r:0.122,g:0.129,b:0.165},\n       dividerDark:{r:0.149,g:0.157,b:0.200}, dividerLight:{r:0.918,g:0.918,b:0.941},\n       gainLight:{r:0.071,g:0.651,b:0.420}, gainDark:{r:0.184,g:0.839,b:0.576} };\n     const solid=(c,o)=>[{type:'SOLID',color:c,opacity:(o===undefined?1:o)}];\n     ```\n   - Helpers: recolor(n,col,skip) recursive fills/strokes; mkText(chars,size,style,col,ls); cardShadow=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.086,g:0.086,b:0.118,a:0.10},offset:{x:0,y:6},radius:18,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}]\n   - setBtnLabel working recipe (for given Button instances): `const t=inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); t.characters=s; t.textAutoResize='NONE'; t.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';` (do not set x/y)\n   - Frame layout plan on 5:2: row1 y=1500: 01 x=0, 02 x=494, 03 x=988, 04 x=1482; row2 y=2516: 05 x=0, 06 x=494, 07 x=988. Theme: 01-03 light (#F6F6FA), 04-07 dark (#0E0F14). TabBar at y=782, home indicator y=862.\n   - Component zone positions planned: QuickAction (0,260), HistoryRow (460,260), CaseRow (940,260), StockHeader (1440,260), Stat (1860,260), PeriodChip (2070,260), KeypadKey (0,400), PinCell (170,400), AccountOption (460,400), ButtonSecondary (900,400), ButtonCompact (1320,400), Dialog (1780,400).\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - get_metadata with sessionId \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\" → \"Invalid sessionId\" → retry without sessionId (all subsequent calls omit sessionId).\n   - figma.getNodeAsync: no such property → use figma.getNodeById(id) (sync).\n   - Call 2 threw \"in set_x: This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\" when setting bl.x on the given Button instance's text child inside Dialog build → entire Call 2 rolled back (inventory confirmed only 7:62 and 7:116 exist; all small components must be recreated). Fix strategy verified by test call: instance-child text overrides allowed for characters/textAutoResize/resize/textAlignHorizontal; constraints enum is 'MIN'|'CENTER'|'MAX'|'STRETCH'|'SCALE'. All new masters must use fixed-width, center/right-aligned text boxes so instance text overrides never need repositioning; dialog Buy uses own VI/Button Compact (137×52) instead of resized given Button.\n   - Screenshots: URL-only responses unusable (no shell tools available) → use enableBase64Response:true.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Designed a coherent mixed system: light onboarding screens (01–03), dark invest screens (04–07) — explicitly allowed by Foundations; shared Inter type scale, #FA5555 accent, radii (16 buttons/16-20 cards/12 inputs/24 dialog), green gains (#12A66B light / #2FD693 dark), brand red as loss/negative color.\n   - Component reuse architecture: given Button instances for full-width CTAs (Start/Ready/Buy) via setBtnLabel; Text Field instances on 06 restyled dark (label secDark, Input fill surfaceDark2, stroke dividerDark, value white); Status Bar/Home Indicator instances everywhere (white glyphs on dark, skip 'Notch' name when recoloring status bar).\n   - Planned per-screen layouts and candle/bar chart data (candles ~20