\n- Quick actions row y=170: three Quick Action instances at x=24,146,268 (110 wide, gap 12) → 24+110=134, +12=146, +110=256, +12=268, +110=378 → right margin 36. Hmm center: total 3×110+2×12=354, start=(414-354)/2=30. Use x=30,152,274.\n- Vulcan Bank card: y=278, 366×180, r20, gradient red (brand #FA5555 → darker #E04040 or #D64545), white text \"Vulcan Bank\" 16 SemiBold at (24,24) inside; card chip? \"no number\" — so no card number. Pager dots below card (not inside): 2 dots centered y=470: current dot accent 8×8, other dividerLight 6×6? Actually dots usually inside/below card. Place dots at y=278+180+12=470 centered.\n  - Card content: \"Vulcan Bank\" top-left, maybe \"Debit card\" small? Keep: 'Vulcan Bank' white 16 SemiBold; bottom-left: '••••'? No number specified — leave just name + maybe a card icon. Add Icon_Card white at top-right? Cute. And wave? Keep simple: brand gradient + name + Icon_Card.\n- History section: y=500: row \"History\" 20 SemiBold textDark left; \"TODAY\" 12 Medium secLight right (x=366 right-aligned fixed box or auto with right align via x placement — top-level frame children can be positioned freely, so auto-resize + manual x is FINE on frames; the fixed-box trick is only needed inside component instances!). Right — on FRAMES I can position freely. Only INSTANCE CHILDREN are restricted. \n  - Search field? \"history search\" is entry-only — include a search input: 366×48 white r12 at y=540 with Icon_Search + 'Search' placeholder secLight.\n  - Rows y=604, 668+? Rows 366×64 each with 8 gap: y=604, 676, 748. Hmm 604+64=668+8=676, 676+64=740+8=748, 748+64=812. Then tab bar at 782?? Conflict. Tab bar at y=782 (80 tall) + home indicator 862. So content must end by ~782. Adjust: card 160 tall instead of 180: card y=270..430, dots y=444, History y=486, search y=522 (48), rows y=586,654,722 (64 each +6 gap) → ends 786. Tight. Let me compute better:\n  - Status bar 44\n  - Safe icon y=60 (24)\n  - \"$3,821\" y=92, h=41 (34 Bold) → ends 133\n  - Quick actions y=156..240 (84)\n  - Card y=264..424 (160 tall)\n  - Dots y=436 (6)\n  - History header y=470 (24) → 'History' 20 SemiBold; TODAY right\n  - Search y=506 (48) → ends 554\n  - Rows: y=570, 638, 706 (64 each, gap 4)? 570+64=634, gap 4 → 638+64=702, gap4 → 706+64=770. Tab bar y=782. Good, 12px gap.\n- Tab Bar instance (Theme=Light, Active=Main) at (0,782)\n- Home Indicator at (0,862)\n\nRow instances overrides:\n- Row1: Icon=Location, Title 'Airbnb', Sub 'Payments', Amount '-$560'\n- Row2: Icon=Transfer, Title 'Anna Nelsen', Sub 'Transfer' — \"to Anna Nelsen\" — hmm brief: \"to Anna Nelsen·Transfer·−$380\". The Sub could be 'Transfer' and maybe Title 'to Anna Nelsen'? The summary said rows: \"to Anna Nelsen·Transfer·−$380\" — I'll set Title='Anna Nelsen', Sub='Transfer' and Amount '-$380'. Wait but then 'to'/'from' distinction lost. Use Sub='Transfer · to'? Hmm. Brief copy exact: rows are \"to Anna Nelsen\" / \"from Anna Nelsen\". I'll set Title='Anna Nelsen', Sub='To · Transfer'? Overthinking: set Title 'Anna Nelsen', Sub 'Transfer', Amounts −$380/+$470. Direction shown by icon (Transfer vs Transfer_In) and +/−. Acceptable. Actually — to be safer with \"fixed copy\", put 'to Anna Nelsen' as Sub? Sub 'Transfer' specified though (\"Transfer·−$380\"). The middle item is category 'Transfer'. Title 'to Anna Nelsen' keeps full fixed copy: Title='to Anna Nelsen', Sub='Transfer', Amount='-$380'. And 'from Anna Nelsen'. Airbnb row: Title='Airbnb', Sub='Payments', Amount='-$560'. Good — matches brief exactly.\n- Row3: Icon=TransferIn, Title 'from Anna Nelsen', Sub 'Transfer', Amount '+$470' — amount green? +$470 gain green (gainLight) — nice touch: fill gainLight.\n\nQuick Action instances: variants Icon=Mycard, Icon=Transfer, Icon=Mobile (names from build: 'Icon=Mycard','Icon=Transfer','Icon=Mobile').\n\nFonts: load all styles used: Regular, Medium, Semi Bold, Bold.\n\nColors light theme: bgLight #F6F6FA (0.965,0.965,0.980), textDark #1A1A1F, secLight #8A8A94, surface white, dividerLight #EAEAEF, accent #FA5555, gainLight #12A66B.\n\nNow, IMPORTANT override constraints for history row instances: Title/Sub/Amount overrides — allowed (chars + fills). Title 'from Anna Nelsen' is longer than 'Airbnb' — auto-resize WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT grows right; fine for left-aligned. Amount is fixed 120 box RIGHT — '-$380' fits.\n\nCard gradient: GradientPaint {type:'GRADIENT_LINEAR', gradientTransform:[[1,0,0],[0,1,0]], gradientStops:[{position:0,color:{r:0.980,g:0.333,b:0.333,a:1}},{position:1,color:{r:0.839,g:0.216,b:0.216,a:1}}]}. \n\nScreen frame: figma.createFrame(), name '01 Home', resize(414,896), x=0,y=1500, fills bgLight, cornerRadius 0. Name per brief: '01_Home'? Brief frame names: 01_Home etc. Use '01_Home'.\n\nHome indicator on light: black — keep default.\n\nAlso add clipContent true (default frames clip? createFrame default clipsContent true I think; set explicitly).\n\nWrite screen 01 build now. Then 02, 03 in next call, 04, 05, 06+07 after, then prototypes, then screenshots.\n\nOne more: status bar instance: create from 1:33. On light screen keep black glyphs. Home indicator 1:44 at y=862.\n\nIcon_Safe: 3:21 recolor accent.\n\nIcon_Card white on card: recolor white.\n\nIcon_Search in search field: recolor secLight #8A8A94.\n\nPager dots: two ellipses at centered positions: total width 8+6+6=20? current dot 8 wide, other 6: 8+6gap? dots: dot1 accent 8×8 at x=193, dot2 #D9D9E0 6×6 at x=205, y baseline aligned: dot1 y=0, dot2 y=1. Center around 207: combined width 8+6+6(gap)=20 → start x=(414-20)/2=197. dot1 x=197 y=436, dot2 x=211 y=437 (6px, center aligned with 8px dot: dot1 center y=440, dot2 y=437+3=440 ✓).\n\nCard details: 'Vulcan Bank' at (24,24) white 16 SemiBold; Icon_Card 24×24 white at (318,24)? card width 366 → x=366-24-24=318, y=24. Maybe also 'Debit' small? skip. Add subtle decorative circle? Keep clean.\n\nLet me write the code. I'll define common helpers again (each call is isolated). Keep code compact.\n\nAlso remember: everything appended to frame via frame.appendChild + set x/y relative to frame.\n\nAlso set frame.clipsContent=true.\n\nFor instance creation from variant: need variant component node. Get by parentId: e.g. qaSet.children.find(c=>c.name==='Icon=Mycard'). I'll fetch sets via getNodeById with ids from last result: qa 13:79, hr 13:102, chip 13:165, pin 13:172, acc 13:186, b2 13:191, compact 13:192, dialog 13:194, case 13:145, stat 13:158, keypad 13:166, stock header 13:146, tabbar 7:62, header 7:116.\n\nVariant lookup helper: function V(set,name){return set.children.find(c=>c.name===name);}\n\nScreen 01 code below. Also I'll add a small \"Safe\" label? No.\n\nAlso brief said \"2 pager dots current 1\" ✓.\n\nWrite call A: screen 01.","signature":"ee30d2515e0a433291b97ea4"}],"id":"872fafba-e48d-407c-8c80-f3ef89e63924","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1c030d6-8623-4883-b4fc-98c71a716f33","uuid":"04338e0c-8b95-4655-b750-985386a568fc","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:39:35.065Z","thinking_duration_ms":55453}
