{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"01_Home done (15:109). Now build 02_About_Investment and 03_Create_PIN in one call.\n\n02 About Investment (light, x=494, y=1500):\n- Status bar\n- Header: back icon (Icon_Back 3:5, textDark) at (24,64)? Actually a simple back arrow row. Title? Brief: \"Investment\" + P1 + P2 + Illustration_Investment + Start button.\n- Layout:\n  - Back icon at (24,64) 24×24 textDark — prototype → 01\n  - \"Investment\" 34 Bold textDark at (24,116)\n  - P1: \"I will help you create an investment portfolio in less than five minutes!\" 16 SemiBold textDark at (24,172), width 366, wrap (auto HEIGHT, resize 366) \n  - P2: \"Have you wanted to invest in the shares of global giants for a long time? Now it is possible by opening a brokerage account. Let's start!\" 14 Regular secLight at (24, ~240), width 340, wrap\n  - Illustration: 3:25 is symbol component (Illustration_Investment, 220×220). Create instance, recolor? Brief: neutral placeholder, may restyle. Place centered (414-220)/2=97, y=320.\n  - Given Button instance 374×56 at x=20, y=790? Wait, tab bar absent on 02, home indicator present. Button at y=786, home indicator 862. Button label 'Start'.\n  \nP1 wrapping: t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(366, h). \n\n03 Create PIN (light, x=988, y=1500):\n- Status bar\n- Back icon (24,64) → 02\n- Title 'Create PIN code' 24 SemiBold centered? Brief: \"Create PIN code\". Center: x=(414-w)/2. Title at y=100.\n- PIN cells row: 4 cells 56×64, gap 16: total 4×56+3×16=272, start x=(414-272)/2=71. y=170. Cells: Filled '9','7','7', Empty. Wait digits 9,7,7 in first three. Cell instances: pinSet 13:172 variants State=Filled/Empty. Filled digit override '9','7','7'.\n- Keypad: keys 110×64, 3 cols gap: total 3×110+2×g. With g=17: 364 → x start 25. Rows 4, gap 16 vertical: total 4×64+3×16=304. Start y=290? Let me compute: keypad bottom must leave room for Ready button at 786. Keys y: 290, 370, 450, 530 (gap 16) → ends 594. Hmm plenty of room; maybe center keypad more: y=300,380,460,540 → ends 604. Ready at 786? Big gap. Fine — or move keypad lower: y=330..594? Let me do rows at y=320, 384, 448, 512 (gap 0?? no). Standard: gap 14: 64×4+14×3=298. y=310 → rows 310, 388, 466, 544 → ends 608. OK.\n  - Columns x: g=17 → 25, 152, 279 (110 each: 25+110=135+17=152, 152+110=262+17=279, 279+110=389 → right margin 25 ✓).\n  - Digits: 1,2,3 / 4,5,6 / 7,8,9 / blank,0,backspace. Letters: 2 ABC,3 DEF,4 GHI,5 JKL,6 MNO,7 PQRS,8 TUV,9 WXYZ; 1 and 0 no letters. Backspace key: icon instead of digit — special: create frame 110×64 white r16 shadow with Icon_Backspace centered textDark.\n- Ready button: given Button 374×56 at (20,786), label 'Ready'. Home indicator. No tab bar.\n\nKeypad overrides: Digit chars, Letters chars ('' for 1,0). Keypad master 'VI/Keypad Key' 13:166 single component (not set) — V lookup: figma.getNodeById('13:166').createInstance().\n\nBackspace icon 3:3 recolor textDark.\n\nFor PIN Empty cell: variant State=Empty. Filled: State=Filled with Digit override.\n\nTitle 'Create PIN code': 24 Semi Bold, centered via x=(414-t.width)/2 on frame — free positioning OK on frame.\n\nAlso subtitle under title? Brief only: title, PIN, keypad, Ready. Maybe small hint 'Enter a four-digit code'? Not specified — skip. Keep faithful.\n\nAlso 02: 'Start' button label override recipe: characters + textAutoResize NONE + align CENTER.\n\nWrite call B.","signature":"de1ea2e4f0c246bf8f98e863"}],"id":"e9af3d31-da3a-4229-b266-25ca2df29b1c","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1c030d6-8623-4883-b4fc-98c71a716f33","uuid":"66ebca94-de4b-48c5-b745-b53c6d23efb0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:40:54.477Z","thinking_duration_ms":22372}
