rk: '100k' y=190, '50k' y=265, '0' y=340.\n  - Bars: 7 months Mar..Sep, values [42,58,38,66,74,60,88]k. Chart plot: x=24..354 (330 wide), 7 bars: slot=330/7≈47, bar width 20 centered in slot. Bar height = value/100k*150. Baseline y=350. So bar y=350-h.\n    - Mar 42k → h63; Apr 58k → 87; May 38k → 57; Jun 66k → 99; Jul 74k → 111; Aug 60k → 90; Sep 88k → 132.\n  - Colors: surfaceDark2 (#1F212A-ish) for normal; Sep accent red. r=8? bars rounded top: use rectangle cornerRadius 6 (all corners; fine).\n  - Month labels under bars: 11px secDark at y=356, centered per slot.\n  - Gridlines: subtle lines at y=200 (100k), 275 (50k), 350 (0): dividerDark, 1px, x=24..390? Behind bars. Optional — add for polish.\n- Cases section: header 'Cases' 20 SemiBold white at (24,400); '4 cases'? not in brief — skip. Rows: Case Row instances 366×64: y=440, 512, 584, 656 (gap 8)? 440+64=504+8=512 ✓ ... 656+64=720. Tab bar 782. Good.\n  - AAPL: default variant (Apple): Ticker AAPL, Company 'Apple Inc.', Price $143.43, Change +31.62 (28.28%) — all defaults ✓\n  - TSLA: Ticker 'TSLA', Company '' (blank), Price '$739.38', Change '+9.21 (1.26%)'\n  - NFLX: Ticker 'NFLX', Company '', Price '$573.14', Change '−2.29 (0.40%)' — use minus sign '−'? Brief: −2.29 (0.40%). Use '−2.29 (0.40%)' with U+2212? Safer ASCII '-2.29 (0.40%)'. Brief shows −. I'll use '−' char (Inter has it). Color: accent red.\n  - MSFT: Ticker 'MSFT', Company '', Price '$294.80', Change '+0.50 (0.17%)'\n  - Logos: variants already carry correct logo.\n  - AAPL row clickable → 05.\n- Tab Bar Dark Invest variant at (0,782), Home indicator white (recolor).\n\nScreen 05 Trading (dark, x=0, y=2516) — next call. Screen 06+07 after.\n\nLet me write 04 now.","signature":"0e360ef4994e47d085dc0ba2"}],"id":"8d540c08-0903-4123-91b1-50f6a5b61ddd","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,