{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/hHw7uGJ7nyDI88HezmYOwV/ (fileKey hHw7uGJ7nyDI88HezmYOwV). Original user message (Chinese): 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。System constraints: confirm assigned account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE, confirmed in prior session); preserve all reference pages; create only inside 03 · Workspace (page 5:2, was empty); starter instructions about read-only/new-file apply to reference pages only — the workspace in this assigned copy IS the delivery location; use only the supplied Figma tools directly (no delegation to other agents); load fonts before text edits; build in manageable sections and check tool results; add the prototype interactions required by the brief; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems (URL-only screenshots unusable — use enableBase64Response:true); a successful screenshot alone is not completion — finish all screens, states and prototype flows; finish with the assigned file URL, the 03 · Workspace page ID, the screen IDs, the prototype work completed, and remaining limitations; do not claim completion for unfinished work. BEFORE EVERY TOOL CALL: visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; after each tool result, same before the next call; final response first line \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\".\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - mcp__figma__use_figma executes stateless JS with the Figma Plugin API; each call is ATOMIC — if the script throws, all mutations roll back (verified twice)\n   - figma.getNodeById(id) is sync; getNodeAsync does NOT exist; figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page) required to switch pages\n   - appendChild() returns void/null in this environment — NEVER chain `.y=` off it\n   - Instance child overrides ALLOWED: characters, textAutoResize, textAlignHorizontal, resize, fills, strokes, effects, visible, constraints (valid enums only). FORBIDDEN: x/y/relative-transform on instance children (throws \"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\" — x/y are implemented via relativeTransform)\n   - constraints enum values: 'MIN' | 'CENTER' | 'MAX' | 'STRETCH' | 'SCALE'\n   - Masters must embed alignment in fixed-width text boxes (textAutoResize='NONE' + resize(w,h) + textAlignHorizontal CENTER/RIGHT) so instance text overrides stay aligned; left-aligned texts can stay auto-resize\n   - setBtnLabel recipe for given Button (1:23) instances (only valid when button NOT resized): `const t=inst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); t.characters=s; t.textAutoResize='NONE'; t.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';` — keeps the 71×19 box at (151.5,18.5) which is centered in the 374-wide button\n   - recolor(n,col,skip): recursive fills/strokes remap; skip 'Notch' when whitening Status Bar on dark screens; Home Indicator recolored white on dark screens\n   - JS pitfall found: `const X={}` followed on next line by a leading `[...]` array expression parses as member access on `{}` (missing ASI) — silently destroys the object; avoid line-leading brackets after object literals\n   - Prototype reactions: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'DISSOLVE', duration:0.3}}}]`; try on instance subnodes, fallback invisible hotspot rects\n   - get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true to view inline (no shell tools available for curl)\n   - sessionId parameter: omit entirely (all-zeros UUID rejected \"Invalid sessionId\")\n   - Palette: accent #FA5555 {0.980,0.333,0.333}; textDark #1A1A1F; secLight #8A8A94 {0.541,0.541,0.580}; secDark #9A9AA6 {0.604,0.604,0.651}; bgLight #F6F6FA {0.965,0.965,0.980}; bgDark #0E0F14 {0.055,0.059,0.078}; surfaceDark2 #1F212A {0.122,0.129,0.165}; dividerDark #262833 {0.149,0.157,0.200}; gainLight #12A66B; gainDark #2FD693 {0.184,0.839,0.576}; dotIdle #D9D9E0; empty-PIN stroke {0.71,0.71,0.75}; Button Secondary Light bg #EAEAF1 {0.918,0.918,0.945}\n   - `solid=(c,o)=>[{type:'SOLID',color:c,opacity:(o===undefined?1:o)}]`; cardShadow=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.086,g:0.086,b:0.118,a:0.10},offset:{x:0,y:6},radius:18,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}]\n   - Fonts: Inter Regular/Medium/Semi Bold/Bold (load all four each call)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file hHw7uGJ7nyDI88HezmYOwV, pages: 0:1 brief, 1:2 foundations, 1:3 components, 1:4 media, 5:2 workspace (delivery target)\n   - 04·Media verified IDs: Illustration_Investment 3:25 (220×220); Logos: Apple 3:26, Microsoft 3:27, Netflix 3:28, Tesla 3:29 (all 48×48 COMPONENTs); Icons (all 24×24 COMPONENTs unless noted): ArrowDown 3:2, ArrowUp 3:4, Back 3:5, Backspace 3:3, Card 3:7, Chart 3:9 (29×26), Insights 3:11, Invest 3:12, Location 3:13, Main 3:14, Menu 3:15, Mobile 3:16, More 3:17, Safe 3:21, Search 3:22, Transfer 3:23, TransferIn 3:24\n   - Given components (structure verified): Button 1:23 = 374×56 r16 #FA5555, text 'Continue' 71×19 at (151.5,18.5) white 16 SemiBold; Text Field 1:26 = 374×77 (Label 'Quantity' 14 SemiBold #1A1A1F at 0,0; Input frame 374×52 white r12 at 0,25; value '0' 16 Regular #9A9AA3 at 17,16.5); Status Bar 1:33 = 414×44 black glyphs ('9:41' text, Notch rect 209×30 at 103,0, Signal/Wifi/Battery); Home Indicator 1:44 = 414×34 (black rect 134×5 at 140,21)\n   - VI/Tab Bar 7:62 — variants 'Theme=Light, Active=Main' and 'Theme=Dark, Active=Invest' (note comma+space in names), 414×80, children: Divi