ab Bar 'Theme=Dark, Active=Invest' (0,782); white home indicator\n   - Build 07_Confirm_Purchase at (988,2516): same content as 06 (shared builder) + dim overlay rect 414×896 black 60% named 'Dim' + VI/Dialog instance (320×196) at (47,350) + Tab Bar + white home indicator (dialog BtnCancel/BtnBuy are instance children named 'BtnCancel'/'BtnBuy')\n   - Wire prototypes (reactions format documented above): 01 'Tab / Invest'→02; 02 'Back'→01, 'BtnStart'→03; 03 'Back'→02, 'BtnReady'→04; 04 'RowAAPL'→05, 'Back'→01, 'Tab / Main'→01; 05 'Back'→04, 'BtnBuy'→06; 06 'Back'→05, 'BtnBuy'→07; 07 dialog 'BtnCancel'→06 (Buy on 07 entry-only). Entry-only (no links): My card, Transfer, Mobile, history search/rows, card pager, Payments/Cashback/More tabs, TSLA/NFLX/MSFT rows, Sell, period chips, Menu/Chart/Insights, EUR account\n   - Screenshot all 7 frames (enableBase64Response:true), fix visual problems, re-verify\n   - Final answer: file URL, page ID 5:2, screen IDs (15:109, 16:176, 16:207, 17:235, 18:440, +06/07 ids), prototype summary, limitations — formatted as \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\"\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Just completed building 05_Trading (frame id 18:440 at (0,2516)) after removing a leftover junk lookup line that had crashed the first attempt. All five screens 01–05 now exist on page 5:2 with correct copy/data/components. Immediately prior, the full component library rebuild succeeded: page inventory returned { 'Vulcan Invest · Design System':'7:2', 'Screens · 414 × 896':'7:3', 'VI/Tab Bar':'7:62', 'VI/Header':'7:116', 'VI/Quick Action':'13:79', 'VI/History Row':'13:102', 'VI/Case Row':'13:145', 'VI/Stock Header':'13:146', 'VI/Stat':'13:158', 'VI/Period Chip':'13:165', 'VI/Keypad Key':'13:166', 'VI/PIN Cell':'13:172', 'VI/Account Option':'13:186', 'VI/Button Secondary':'13:191', 'VI/Button Compact':'13:192', 'VI/Dialog':'13:194' }.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Build screens 06 and 07 in a single use_figma call using a shared content builder (stat